  "verbatim": "the gold's D1 tokens (answer_selection._tokens) as a contiguous whole-token run of the text's D1 tokens (ASCII case-insensitive regex, cross-checked against the normalised form); stricter than D1's substring branch, no all-tokens branch",
  "placement": "segment_prompt line spans (separator excluded); question = 'Question:' to '\\n\\nNote:'; elsewhere = any whole-prompt match outside the one evidence line",
