   "G not verbatim anywhere in the swap prompt",
   "same teacher-forced leading-whitespace tokens as G",
   "different first content token"
  ],
  "first_token": "jlens_readout.tracked_token_ids: first non-whitespace token of ids(' ' + text) (the token P1 predicts in §34); continuation_first_id form ids('Answer:' + ' ' + text) - ids('Answer:') checked",
  "alignment": "patching.check_alignment on readout_for(clean) vs readout_for(swap), gold forced as §34; the cut-is-shorter clause off (n_evidence_lines=0); tracked ids and forced whitespace must match",
