   "determiner": "first word in ['the', 'a', 'an', 'my', 'our', 'his', 'her', 'their', 'its'] (membership case-insensitive, followed by another word): the same word as written in S ('The' != 'the', else the read is the determiner's case), or none in both; every kept type",
